{"id":725,"name":"litten","speciesId":725,"dex":725,"form":"normal","generation":7,"types":["fire"],"stats":{"hp":45,"attack":65,"defense":40,"special-attack":60,"special-defense":40,"speed":70},"abilities":[{"name":"blaze","hidden":false},{"name":"intimidate","hidden":true}],"height":4,"weight":43,"baseExp":64,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/725.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/725.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/725.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/725.ogg","genus":"Fire Cat Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"sun","text":"While grooming itself, it builds up fur inside its stomach. It sets the fur alight and spews fiery attacks, which change based on how it coughs."},{"version":"moon","text":"It doesn’t allow its emotions to be easily seen. Earning its trust takes time. It prefers solitude."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"If you try too hard to get close to it, it won’t open up to you. Even if you do grow close, giving it too much affection is still a no-no."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its coat regrows twice a year. When the time comes, Litten sets its own body on fire and burns away the old fur."},{"version":"sword","text":"It spends even the smallest amount of downtime grooming its fur with its tongue. Loose fur gathers in its stomach and serves as fuel for fiery moves."},{"version":"shield","text":"Trying to pet Litten before it trusts you will result in a nasty scratch from its sharp claws. Be careful."}],"genderRate":1,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["ground"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"litten","speciesId":725,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 17"],"species":"torracat","speciesId":726,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 34"],"species":"incineroar","spec